# Sources of the study of the earlier in-house NUMS.Go study and its miniature (hub 3.8). Line ranges sit in the citing claim. Commits of the parent repository are cited as 2.3#commit-<hash>, commits of NUMS.Go as 2.2#commit-<hash>.

n: 2.16
name: nums-study-sources
kind: hub
is: The primary sources behind hub 3.8: the round-two study report on the folder nums-go-2023, the folder's eight text and Python files, the NUMS.Go files the study re-read, the documents of the parent repository, of the old body and of two sibling checkouts that carry the ice, water and gas vocabulary, and the first-round critique and core report.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r2/gap-nums-study-2023

